              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Rebecca A Goodrich"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I upgraded this recipe by using organic ingredients, toasting the pecans first, scanting the sugar, and upping the vanilla to a tablespoon..\n\nI found that using a bit of organic whipping cream with non-fat Greek yogurt counter-balanced the sugar in the recipe, and the fats in the nuts. I also like it with toasted walnuts, which add omega-3s.",
