              "name": "CalmMug8718"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I cooked the pecan delight for 25 minutes like the recipe said, but while it was baking it smelled like something was burning. When I took it out of the oven it was burnt around the edges. I put the whipped cream on after it cooled and refrigerated it. I had a piece and could not eat the edges, they were burnt. I did not think the taste was that good. I probably will not make this again. I think 25 minutes was too long to bake it.",
